# Production build config — PUBLIC values only.
#
# The Supabase URL and anon/publishable key are safe to expose (they ship in
# the client bundle; Row Level Security enforces access). Do NOT put secrets
# here. Set SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and STRIPE_* in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables); dashboard values override this.
#
# When reselling to a new client, point these at their own Supabase project.

